WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.150
Oh, hi, everyone!

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.630
Here in Washington, DC, the weather changes often.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.790
One day is cold and windy.

4
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.030
But the next day is warm and sunny!

5
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.290
So, every day I check the forecast.

6
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:19.730
Hello, Phone?

7
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.690
What is today’s temperature?

8
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.770
Today it is 18 degrees...

9
00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.470
Eighteen degrees! That is cold!

10
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.710
...eighteen degrees Celsius.

11
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.330
Oh, Celsius.

12
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.690
That is 65 degrees Fahrenheit.

13
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.070
That’s warm.

14
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.810
Yes, Anna. It is warm.

15
00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.250
Excuse me, Phone.

16
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.310
Is it windy today?

17
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:46.050
No, it is not windy today.

18
00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.530
Is it sunny today?

19
00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.110
Yes, Anna.

20
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.770
It is sunny.

21
00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:53.530
Excuse me, Phone?

22
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.170
Yes, Anna.

23
00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:57.530
Is it snowy today?

24
00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.090
No, Anna.

25
00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.190
It is not snowy.

26
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.090
Thank you, Phone!

27
00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.370
Today the weather is warm and sunny -- great for seeing Washington, D.C.

28
00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:15.270
Phone! It is not warm and sunny!

29
00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:19.950
It is cold and windy and snowy!

30
00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:24.530
Anna, it is not cold, windy, or snowy.

31
00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:31.390
It is warm and sunny … in Mexico City, Mexico.

32
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.590
Oh. I see. Mexico.

33
00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.070
Washington weather changes often.

34
00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:44.830
Remember to check the forecast -- the right forecast.

35
00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:46.150
Yes, Anna.

36
00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.430
Next time remember to check the right fore...

37
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.770
Okay, thank you Phone.

38
00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:51.950
Goodbye, Phone.

39
00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.970
Until next time.

40
00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.670
Yes, until next time.
